---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="story">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
      Why the Barred Owl?
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">Because he's local, and he works the night shift.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
      The barred owl hunts the woods along the Hudson, the same woods behind our clients' shops and
      lumber yards. He's awake when the owners can't be. His call sounds like a question:{' '}
      <em>who cooks for you?</em>
      Our whole job starts with questions. We ask, we listen, and then we make sure somebody's
      always there to answer yours.
    </p>
    <blockquote class="mt-7 max-w-md border-l-[3px] border-amber pl-5 font-serif text-2xl leading-snug italic">
      Most owls blend in. Ours is done blending in.
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</Section>
